{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, סוֹף","hw":"סוֹף","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סוֹף</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] end;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span> <em>end</em> of the earth <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:8\" href=\"/Daniel.4.8\">Dn 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">סוֹפָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:28\" href=\"/Daniel.7.28\">7:28</a> <em>end, conclusion</em> of the matter; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־ס׳</span> = <em>for ever</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:27\" href=\"/Daniel.6.27\">6:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:26\" href=\"/Daniel.7.26\">7:26</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, סוּפֹּנְיָה","prev":"BDB Aramaic, סוּף"}